## [0.3.0] - 2026-02-09

### Added
- 195 CQRS use case files (13 entities x 5 operations x 3 files) with MediatR + FluentValidation
- Entity-level folder segregation across ALL layers (Controllers, UseCases, Services)
- ServicesController for Service entity (previously missing)
- Antiforgery middleware for CSRF protection
- 12-rule ASP.NET Core middleware ordering in Program.cs
- Polly resilience: HTTP policies on Keycloak HttpClient, DB policy in UnitOfWork
- Middleware ordering documentation (Rulebook Section 12)
- Temporary file cleanup rules (Rulebook Section 13)
- Cross-layer folder consistency rule (Rulebook Section 6.1)
- Pre-commit checks 7 (temp file detection) and 8 (category grouping folder detection)

### Changed
- Reorganized controllers from Core/Chatbot subfolders to individual entity folders
- Reorganized UseCases from Core/Chatbot subfolders to entity-level folders (UseCases/{Entity}/)
- Reorganized Services from Core/Chatbot subfolders to entity-level folders (Services/{Entity}/)
- Updated 200+ namespace references across all layers to match new folder structure
- Fixed ServiceHistoriesController (had duplicate ServicesController content)
- Moved Liquibase scripts from API layer to Infrastructure/Persistance/Liquibase
- Moved logs folder from API/logs to app/server/logs (shared location)
- Updated log paths in appsettings.json and appsettings.Development.json
- Updated AutoMapper DomainToDtoProfile with all 13 entity mappings
- Expanded ErrorCodes.cs with ID validation codes for all entities
- Updated Rulebook to v3.0 with middleware, cleanup, and cross-layer consistency rules

### Removed
- 124+ temporary files (tmpclaude-*, .bak, migration logs, nul)
- Program.cs.bak backup file
- Category subfolders Core/ and Chatbot/ from Controllers/, UseCases/, and Services/
- Ambiguous Polly singleton policy registrations from DI

### Version Bump
**Proposed:** minor (0.2.0 -> 0.3.0)
**Reason:** New features (CQRS use cases, middleware pipeline, Polly wiring), backward compatible
